twodrive (0.2.17-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Invalidate cached bytes and in-flight downloads on remote version changes.
  * Revalidate FUSE file sizes and keep reads on their opened cache descriptor.
  * Reject inconsistent cache lengths and remote edits during downloads.
  * Preserve local writes, conflict copies and same-version metadata echoes.
  * Add remote-update, download-publication and mounted ZIP regressions.
  * Retain standard offline dpkg-buildpackage/debhelper source and binary builds.

